# Studio is a separate private application. Nothing here is exposed with a VITE_ prefix.
# Prefer npm run local:start && npm run local:setup for isolated local development.
# Manual staging setup must apply migrations and provision a NOINHERIT login granted catalog_backend.
# Never run Studio with a database-owner login or service-role credentials.
CATALOG_DATABASE_URL=postgresql://catalog_studio_login:REPLACE_PRIVATELY@127.0.0.1:54322/postgres
SUPABASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:54321
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# Generate a private value: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
CATALOG_SESSION_SECRET=
# Non-secret operator identity, independently pinned to the database. Never use a file from an untrusted release sender.
# Existing local projects: local:migrate, then local:realm-setup. New local:setup writes this automatically.
CATALOG_RELEASE_REALM_FILE=.build/catalog-local/realm.json
CATALOG_STUDIO_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:5174
CATALOG_STUDIO_PORT=4180
CATALOG_STUDIO_UI_PORT=5174

# Required in production: absolute persistent private directory outside the repository/web root.
# Also set CATALOG_STUDIO_ORIGIN to the public HTTPS reverse-proxy origin.
# Back up private media with the database; the ignored .build default is development-only.
# Uploads are content-addressed, EXIF-stripped WebP; only referenced files belong in a release.
# Optional, explicit small-host upload policy. Unset/default retains 40 MP and existing concurrency.
# low-memory: 2.5 MP (includes 1080p), one admitted upload per process/store; excess requests get 429 before body reads.
# Both profiles keep the 10 MB limit, lossless WebP normalization and existing media unchanged.
# This is not a hosting-memory guarantee; measure the complete workload and retain one Studio instance.
# For small Linux/glibc hosts, see docs/project/deployment.md for pre-launch allocator/thread/heap settings.
# In particular, setting MALLOC_ARENA_MAX via Node's --env-file is too late to establish the tested launch environment.
# CATALOG_MEDIA_PROFILE=low-memory
# CATALOG_MEDIA_ROOT=/absolute/private/path/to/gamemap-media
# CATALOG_STUDIO_HOST=127.0.0.1
